    "%@ 打卡日(%lld天)平均心情 %@ / 5;非打卡日(%lld天)平均 %@ / 5。仅描述差异,不推断因果。" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "On %@ check-in days (%lld days), average mood was %@ / 5; on non-check-in days (%lld days), average was %@ / 5. Difference only; no causal inference."
          }
