    "支持类型:%@。睡眠、步数和锻炼时间为只读;每个选中的类型都会在请求时一并申请。Apple 健康不会向 Maren 暴露读权限是否被拒绝,请在「健康」App 中管理权限。数据只在本机与 Apple 健康之间流转,不经过开发者服务器。停止自动同步只会停止后续自动读写,不会替你撤销 Apple 健康权限或删除数据。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Supported types: %@. Sleep, step count, and exercise time are read-only; all selected types are requested together. Apple Health does not tell Maren whether read access was denied; manage permissions in the Health app. Data stays between this device and Apple Health and does not pass through a developer server. Stopping automatic sync only stops future reads and writes; it does not revoke Apple Health permissions or delete data."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
